			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"「海亂鬼」",
					"朝倉"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 728040206,
					"content": "哎喲！好漢，好漢留手！你這是從哪裡找來的幫手…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040207,
					"content": "惡徒！現在就把武器還給我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040208,
					"content": "你、你居然還惦記著那把武器…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040209,
					"content": "我只為取回我的武器，你告訴我那把武器在哪，我留你一條生路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040210,
					"content": "這…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040211,
						728040212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040211,
					"content": "別和他廢話了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040213,
					"content": "啊喲！好漢留手！怎得如此暴躁，我也沒說我不說啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040214,
					"content": "那…那把武器，被我們老大留著當藏品了，你們要是想拿，去那邊的營地裡找他就可以了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040215,
					"content": "哼，算你識相。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040216,
					"content": "那二位好漢，在下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040217,
					"content": "滾！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040218,
					"content": "是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040219,
					"content": "武藝不怎麼樣，逃跑倒是挺在行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040220,
					"content": "賣同伴賣得這麼果斷…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040221,
					"content": "海亂鬼終歸只是一群為利而聚的烏合之眾，談不上什麼忠誠，也談不上什麼信念。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040222,
					"content": "遇見了麻煩事，第一反應是拍屁股走人，這實在是太正常不過了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040223,
					"content": "不過，還是多虧了閣下在一旁以聲勢壓人，不然他可不會這麼容易就服軟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040224,
					"content": "但接下來，我們就必須直奔海亂鬼的大本營了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040225,
					"content": "還是依照之前的計畫，閣下，我會直接去斬了那個頭領，剩下的雜魚就交給閣下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040226,
						728040227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040226,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040228
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040228,
					"content": "那就拜託閣下了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040227,
					"content": "我一個打十個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040228
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040212,
					"content": "我們還是找下一個人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040213
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7280403,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7280405
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7280405",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7280405,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"「海亂鬼」首領"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 728040301,
					"content": "你？哈哈哈，不是上次的那個毛頭小子嗎？怎麼，又來給我送藏品了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040302,
					"content": "我是來取回我的武器的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040303,
					"content": "嗯…不錯，倒是有點膽色。但只找了一個幫手就敢闖到這裡來，你未免也太看不起我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040304,
					"content": "不過，看在你到這裡的這份膽色上，我就給你這個機會，上前來！我們去旁邊玩玩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040305,
					"content": "#但是嘛…我這些手下當然也不能閒著，你不是帶了個幫手來嗎？就讓{M#他}{F#她}來陪他們玩一玩吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040306,
						728040307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040306,
					"content": "儘管放馬過來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040308,
					"content": "哈哈哈，口氣倒是挺大。小的們，給我好好…處理一下這傢伙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040309,
					"content": "至於你，我們去旁邊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040310,
					"content": "#那就交給{F#妳}{M#你}了，閣下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040311,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040312,
					"content": "不勝感激。我會馬上把他斬掉，然後回來幫您的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040313,
					"content": "你的口氣也不小啊，想要斬我的話，就自己來試試吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「海亂鬼」首領"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040307,
					"content": "只怕我玩得不盡興。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040308
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7280404,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7280407
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7280407",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7280407,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"朝倉"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 728040406,
					"content": "#閣下，看{F#妳}{M#你}氣息平穩，那些海亂鬼對{F#妳}{M#你}而言，果然不算什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040407,
					"content": "看起來你也贏了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040408,
					"content": "沒錯，但是很慚愧…最後那傢伙居然虛晃一招，拼著被我刺了一槍後逃跑了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040409,
					"content": "但是他傷得很重，我想，幾年內他應該不可能再出來作亂了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040410,
					"content": "最主要的是，我親手擊敗了他，也奪回了武器，徹底洗刷了恥辱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040411,
					"content": "恭喜你，朝倉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040412
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 728040412,
					"content": "實在感謝，但我還不能鬆懈！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040413,
					"content": "這一切的起因，都是我的武藝還不夠精湛，以後我會繼續加倍刻苦修煉，精進武藝的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040414,
					"content": "所以…還請閣下多多關照，常來和我對練了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040415,
					"content": "哦，對了，這些東西還請閣下收下。雖然不算太多…但也是我的一份心意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						728040416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				},
				{
					"id": 728040416,
					"content": "再次謝謝您，閣下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "朝倉"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}